1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,341
The whole grammar of conditionals lies in one question: how real is the condition?

2
00:00:06,341 --> 00:00:12,226
English answers by choosing a tense, and it is often not the tense of the time being talked about.

3
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:17,356
So learn four fixed patterns, instead of reasoning them out every time.

